 nextPlain:Z("先补齐 fresh source-trajectory 的 content-addressed provenance，再决定扩展是否值得进入新的行为实验；核心 C1 不需要为了扩展 blocker 重跑。","Close content-addressed provenance for fresh source trajectories before any new behavioral extension; do not rerun canonical C1 because of an extension blocker."),
